  "prefLabel": "Mid 404.04 Procedure for Imposition of Sanctions",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-11-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mid 404.04 Procedure for Imposition of Sanctions. Other than the immediate suspension of certification authorized by RSA 541-A:30, III, the council shall impose disciplinary sanctions only:\n\n(a) After prior notice to the certificate holder in accordance with Mid 207.01 and the opportunity for the certificate holder to be heard; or\n\n(b) By agreement in a settlement between the council and the certificate holder made pursuant to Mid 213.\n\nSource. #9090, eff 2-20-08, EXPIRED: 2-20-16\n\nNew. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16\n\nNew. #12040, eff 11-10-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mid400.html"
